What this covers
----------------

CC BY 4.0 applies to the auto-derived form definitions:

  - <Name>/index.json           — each type's form definition (JSON)
  - corpus.jsonl                — every form, one per line
  - index.json                  — name → form URL
  - reverse-index.json          — urn:solid type → form URL

What this does NOT cover
------------------------

Pane code and build scripts remain licensed under AGPL-3.0 (see LICENSE):

  - ui-pane.js                  — the inline-edit pane (the interesting bit)
  - shacl-pane.js               — the SHACL explicit-submit alternate
  - scripts/*.js                — build + validate pipeline
  - index.html, demos/*         — the demo hub and example pages

The split mirrors solid-shapes: the *form definitions* are data
(reusable contracts describing how to render a type), the *renderer*
is code.
